B.c3f=new A.ds("Be respectful","Harassment, bullying, threats, hate speech, discrimination, sexual exploitation, and encouragement of violence or self-harm are prohibited.")
B.c37=new A.ds("Keep content appropriate","Do not post sexually explicit material, graphic violence, spam, fraud, impersonation, illegal goods or services, malware, or content that violates another person's privacy or intellectual-property rights.")
B.c2P=new A.ds("Share hair-care information responsibly","Do not present a personal experience as a guaranteed result or post dangerous or misleading health claims. Do not tell users to stop prescribed treatment, provide individualized medicine or supplement dosing, or promote prescription, illegal, unapproved, or recalled products. Clearly disclose commercial relationships. Undisclosed advertising, counterfeit-product offers, cure claims, and health scams are prohibited.")
B.c36=new A.ds("Protect children","Child sexual abuse and exploitation (CSAE) is strictly prohibited. Do not create, upload, share, request, promote, or facilitate child sexual abuse material, grooming, sexualization of minors, sextortion, trafficking, or any predatory interaction with a child. Use the in-app Child safety or exploitation report reason for suspected violations. If a child may be in immediate danger, contact local law enforcement or the appropriate child-safety authority.")
B.c30=new A.ds("Protect personal information","Do not publish another person's private contact, financial, identity, location, or appointment information without permission. Use customer and direct messages only for legitimate booking and service communication.")
B.c3l=new A.ds("Use shop messaging appropriately","Owners may use contact-safe customer details only for the shop-stamped appointment and related service support. Do not use shop customer access for spam, unrelated marketing, bulk solicitation, impersonation, or sharing a customer\u2019s details with other staff or customers. Use the ordinary direct chat between an owner and staff member, and owner-only team announcements only for legitimate shop operations. Do not use workplace access to harass, intimidate, retaliate against, or expose private information about a team member.")
B.c3i=new A.ds("Screening and enforcement","Text content, including direct and shop messages, may be automatically screened before it is posted where screening is enabled. Hair-community submissions are held privately for review before publication. New profile and gallery photos are held privately for review before they can be published. Screening and review can make mistakes and may not catch every violation, so they do not replace user reports. Authorized service operators may review submitted posts, photos, and reports and take action when these guidelines are violated. Publication does not certify medical accuracy.")
B.c3_=new A.ds("Report and block","Use the in-app report action for supported content or behavior that breaks these guidelines. In an ordinary direct chat, a user or specific message can be reported. The safety action in a shop-customer conversation or team announcement instead reports the sender\u2019s account; it does not attach that shop message or announcement as the report target. Reports are handled by authorized safety reviewers, not by the shop owner. Block a sender account to stop new direct interaction; blocking does not cancel an appointment or end a shop membership. Repeated or serious violations may result in content removal or account suspension. A suspended user may ask Support for a review using the case reference shown in the app.")
